---
---

<section id="garante" class="relative py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-slate-950/70 to-transparent border-y border-slate-800/60 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background lighting -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[350px] bg-emerald-500/10 blur-[130px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
        <span>Compromiso con la Integridad Académica</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Más que un generador de texto, <br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          un garante de tu aprendizaje real
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Las herramientas convencionales de IA generan documentos que el alumno suele entregar sin leer. 
        <strong>Agnes asegura que domines el tema antes de presentarlo ante tus docentes.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Info Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Descarga bloqueada</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Los botones para exportar en Word (.docx) y PDF (.pdf) permanecen inhabilitados hasta que demuestres tu comprensión conceptual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">10 Preguntas con IA</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Google Gemini formula 10 preguntas de selección múltiple elaboradas directamente a partir del texto y conceptos de tu protocolo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">80% Mínimo de Aprobación</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Debes responder correctamente al menos 8 de las 10 preguntas. Si fallas, la app te da retroalimentación y pistas para reintentar.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom summary banner -->
    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 shadow-sm">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Objetivo Pedagógico:</span>
        <span>Entregas un protocolo institucional impecable y dominas los temas para la sustentación presencial.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
